<p>What kind of employer lets people smoke inside?</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Back in the day, they let everybody smoke everywhere.</p>
<p>One of the many things I need to work on is setting scenes better; I realized I hadn't done that too well in this one, so when I had them signing out on a paper logbook I thought <em>oh yeah, better mention typewriters and cigarettes, that'll make things clearer.</em></p>
<p>I'm glad you liked it overall! The contest was eye opening - this tale has its weaknesses, for sure, but banging it out in a few hours and then spending another couple hours revising (after the contest ends) is a way easier and better process than my usual M.O. of picking at it for weeks and weeks. Now I just need to figure how to do that without the pressure of a deadline.</p>

